1	{"id":"7ycRUoZBE0LLoWEn","name":"Workshop 2 - ระบบทำข้อสอบออนไลน์ด้วย n8n Form & n8n Data Table (HTML Response)","nodes":[{"parameters":{"content":"## 📝 Workshop 2: ระบบทำข้อสอบออนไลน์ (HTML Response)\\n\\n**กระบวนการทำงาน:**\\n1. 📋 **n8n Form Trigger**: ฟอร์มรับข้อมูลนักเรียนและคำถาม 3 ข้อ\\n2. 🧮 **Calculate Score (Code)**: ตรวจคำตอบ คำนวณคะแนน เปอร์เซ็นต์ และสถานะ ผ่าน/ไม่ผ่าน\\n3. 🔍 **Check Existing in Data Table**: ค้นหาใน Data Table ว่ามีชื่อนักเรียนคนนี้เคยส่งแล้วหรือไม่\\n4. 🔀 **If Node (Check Exists)**: แยกเส้นทางการทำงาน\\n   - 🟢 **False (ยังไม่เคยส่ง)** ➡️ บันทึกลง Data Table ➡️ สร้าง HTML ผลสอบ ➡️ **Form: แสดงผลคะแนนสอบ (Completion)**\\n   - 🔴 **True (เคยส่งแล้ว)** ➡️ สร้าง HTML แจ้งเตือนส่งซ้ำ ➡️ **Form: แจ้งเตือนการส่งซ้ำ (Completion)**","height":520,"width":400,"color":3},"id":"bb82dc8f-452d-4447-b13b-2c5ff3e18c30","name":"Sticky Note - ภาพรวมระบบทำข้อสอบ","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-640,400]},{"parameters":{"content":"## 🗃️ การสร้าง n8n Data Table\\n\\n1. ในเมนูด้านซ้ายของ n8n เลือก **Data Tables**\\n2. กด **Create table** และตั้งชื่อว่า `exam_results`\\n3. เพิ่มคอลัมน์ดังนี้:\\n   - `student_name` (Text)\\n   - `grade_level` (Text)\\n   - `subject` (Text)\\n   - `test_name` (Text)\\n   - `score` (Number)\\n   - `total_score` (Number)\\n   - `percentage` (Number)\\n   - `pass_status` (Text)\\n   - `answer_1` (Text) — คำตอบข้อ 1\\n   - `answer_2` (Text) — คำตอบข้อ 2\\n   - `answer_3` (Text) — คำตอบข้อ 3\\n   - `is_correct_1` (Boolean) — ข้อ 1 ถูก/ผิด\\n   - `is_correct_2` (Boolean) — ข้อ 2 ถูก/ผิด\\n   - `is_correct_3` (Boolean) — ข้อ 3 ถูก/ผิด\\n   - `submitted_at` (Text / Date)","height":560,"width":380,"color":5},"id":"3f519aad-933d-459d-866d-e95bf64bf8c3","name":"Sticky Note - วิธีสร้าง Data Table","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[0,0]},{"parameters":{"content":"## 🎨 เทคนิคการตอบกลับแบบ HTML ใน n8n Form\\n\\n- โหนด **n8n Form** ใช้การตั้งค่า:\\n  - `operation`: **completion**\\n  - `respondWith`: **showText**\\n  - `responseText`: `={{ $json.html }}`\\n- ใช้ Code Node ประกอบ HTML ด้วย **Inline Styles (`style=\\"...\\"`)** เพื่อให้ n8n เรนเดอร์หน้าตา UI ได้สวยงามและปลอดภัย","height":380,"width":440,"color":2},"id":"8d85d301-99a9-4420-98b3-d2fbd471d584","name":"Sticky Note - การแสดงผล HTML","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[448,0]},{"parameters":{"authentication":"none","formTitle":"แบบทดสอบออนไลน์: วิชาวิทยาศาสตร์ ม.1","formDescription":"เรื่อง หน่วยของสิ่งมีชีวิตและกระบวนการดำรงชีวิต (คะแนนเต็ม 10 คะแนน)","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldLabel":"ชื่อ-นามสกุล นักเรียน","fieldType":"text","placeholder":"","defaultValue":"","requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"ระดับชั้น / ห้องเรียน","fieldType":"text","placeholder":"เช่น ม.1/1","defaultValue":"","requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"ข้อ 1: ข้อใดคือหน่วยพื้นฐานที่เล็กที่สุดของสิ่งมีชีวิต?","fieldType":"dropdown","defaultValue":"","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"เซลล์ (Cell)"},{"option":"อะตอม (Atom)"},{"option":"เนื้อเยื่อ (Tissue)"},{"option":"อวัยวะ (Organ)"}]},"multiselect":false,"requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"ข้อ 2: พืชใช้ก๊าซใดเป็นวัตถุดิบหลักในกระบวนการสังเคราะห์ด้วยแสง?","fieldType":"dropdown","defaultValue":"","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"คาร์บอนไดออกไซด์ (CO2)"},{"option":"ออกซิเจน (O2)"},{"option":"ไนโตรเจน (N2)"},{"option":"ไฮโดรเจน (H2)"}]},"multiselect":false,"requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"ข้อ 3: อุณหภูมิจุดเดือดของน้ำบริสุทธิ์ที่ระดับน้ำทะเลคือเท่าใด?","fieldType":"dropdown","defaultValue":"","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"100 องศาเซลเซียส"},{"option":"0 องศาเซลเซียส"},{"option":"50 องศาเซลเซียส"},{"option":"37 องศาเซลเซียส"}]},"multiselect":false,"requiredField":true}]},"responseMode":"onReceived","addFormPage":"","options":{"buttonLabel":"ส่งคำตอบและดูผลคะแนน"}},"id":"7776ea68-2671-4d46-a46b-5a9cf9b52d9c","name":"n8n Form Trigger","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[-368,544],"webhookId":"3e0c82d8-3944-4d1a-a4ee-4fa92037386f"},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"const items = $input.all();\\nconst results = [];\\n\\n// นิยามคำถามแต่ละข้อ + เงื่อนไขคำตอบที่ถูกต้อง (ใช้ .includes เพื่อให้ทนต่อการเปลี่ยน label เล็กน้อย)\\nconst QUESTIONS = [\\n  { key: 'ข้อ 1: ข้อใดคือหน่วยพื้นฐานที่เล็กที่สุดของสิ่งมีชีวิต?', correctMatch: 'เซลล์' },\\n  { key: 'ข้อ 2: พืชใช้ก๊าซใดเป็นวัตถุดิบหลักในกระบวนการสังเคราะห์ด้วยแสง?', correctMatch: 'คาร์บอนไดออกไซด์' },\\n  { key: 'ข้อ 3: อุณหภูมิจุดเดือดของน้ำบริสุทธิ์ที่ระดับน้ำทะเลคือเท่าใด?', correctMatch: '100' }\\n];\\n\\nfor (const item of items) {\\n  const data = item.json;\\n\\n  const studentName = data['ชื่อ-นามสกุล นักเรียน'] || 'ไม่ระบุชื่อ';\\n  const gradeLevel = data['ระดับชั้น / ห้องเรียน'] || 'ม.1/1';\\n\\n  // เก็บคำตอบดิบของแต่ละข้อ + เช็คถูก/ผิดเป็นรายข้อ เพื่อบันทึกลง Data Table\\n  const answers = QUESTIONS.map((q) => data[q.key] || '');\\n  const isCorrect = QUESTIONS.map((q, i) => answers[i].includes(q.correctMatch));\\n  const correctCount = isCorrect.filter(Boolean).length;\\n\\n  let score = 0;\\n  if (correctCount === 3) score = 10.0;\\n  else if (correctCount === 2) score = 6.67;\\n  else if (correctCount === 1) score = 3.33;\\n  else score = 0.0;\\n\\n  const totalScore = 10.0;\\n  const percentage = Math.round((score / totalScore) * 100 * 10) / 10;\\n  const passStatus = percentage >= 50 ? 'ผ่าน' : 'ไม่ผ่าน';\\n\\n  results.push({\\n    json: {\\n      student_name: studentName,\\n      grade_level: gradeLevel,\\n      subject: 'วิทยาศาสตร์',\\n      test_name: 'แบบทดสอบบทที่ 1: หน่วยของสิ่งมีชีวิต',\\n      score: score,\\n      total_score: totalScore,\\n      percentage: percentage,\\n      pass_status: passStatus,\\n      correct_count: correctCount,\\n      total_questions: 3,\\n      // คำตอบรายข้อ + ถูก/ผิดรายข้อ สำหรับบันทึกลง Data Table\\n      answer_1: answers[0],\\n      answer_2: answers[1],\\n      answer_3: answers[2],\\n      is_correct_1: isCorrect[0],\\n      is_correct_2: isCorrect[1],\\n      is_correct_3: isCorrect[2],\\n      submitted_at: new Date().toLocaleString('th-TH')\\n    }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nreturn results;","notice":""},"id":"950bd6e1-e228-4d42-a123-acc40a4e91cd","name":"Calculate Score","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-128,544]},{"parameters":{"resource":"row","operation":"get","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"value":"exam_results","mode":"name"},"matchType":"anyCondition","filters":{},"returnAll":false,"limit":50,"orderBy":false},"id":"a60876aa-3b89-4775-9f1f-2176fff68231","name":"Check Existing in Data Table","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","typeVersion":1,"position":[112,544],"alwaysOutputData":true},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"loose","version":1},"conditions":[{"id":"cond-has-student","leftValue":"={{ $json.student_name }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"exists","singleValue":true}},{"id":"cond-has-id","leftValue":"={{ $json.id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"exists","singleValue":true}}],"combinator":"and"},"looseTypeValidation":false,"options":{}},"id":"13a8fa8c-0862-44ce-a389-8e87296025cb","name":"Student Already Exists?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[352,544]},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"const calc = $('Calculate Score').first().json;\\n\\nconst html = `\\n<div style=\\"max-width:540px;margin:20px auto;padding:24px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #fee2e2;box-shadow:0 10px 25px -5px rgba(239,68,68,0.15);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;\\">\\n  <div style=\\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\\">\\n    <div style=\\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:70px;height:70px;background:#fef2f2;border:2px solid #fecaca;border-radius:50%;font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;\\">\\n      ⚠️\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 14px;background:#ef4444;color:#ffffff;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:8px;\\">\\n      ตรวจพบการส่งซ้ำ\\n    </div>\\n    <h2 style=\\"margin:8px 0 4px;font-size:22px;color:#991b1b;font-weight:700;\\">คุณเคยส่งแบบทดสอบนี้แล้ว</h2>\\n    <p style=\\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#64748b;\\">ระบบได้บันทึกผลสอบของท่านไว้ใน Data Table เรียบร้อยแล้ว</p>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:18px 0;\\">\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">ชื่อ-นามสกุล:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.student_name}</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">ระดับชั้น:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.grade_level}</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">วิชา:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.subject}</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"background:#fffbeb;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:13px;color:#92400e;line-height:1.5;\\">\\n    💡 <strong>ข้อแนะนำ:</strong> เพื่อความโปร่งใส ระบบไม่อนุญาตให้ทำข้อสอบซ้ำ หากมีข้อสงสัยหรือมีเหตุจำเป็น กรุณาติดต่อครูผู้สอนประจำวิชา\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n`;\\n\\nreturn [{ json: { html } }];","notice":""},"id":"a44cd990-a297-44c4-86cd-30aeb9c9566c","name":"Format Warning HTML","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[608,448]},{"parameters":{"triggerNotice":"","operation":"completion","respondWith":"showText","responseText":"={{ $json.html }}","limitWaitTime":false},"id":"cd2fc273-e91a-4565-820e-dfd9f379ea97","name":"Form: แจ้งเตือนการส่งซ้ำ","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","typeVersion":1,"position":[848,448],"webhookId":"science-exam-duplicate-warn"},{"parameters":{"resource":"row","operation":"insert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"value":"exam_results","mode":"name"},"columns":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{"student_name":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.student_name }}","grade_level":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.grade_level }}","subject":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.subject }}","test_name":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.test_name }}","score":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.score }}","total_score":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.total_score }}","percentage":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.percentage }}","pass_status":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.pass_status }}","answer_1":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.answer_1 }}","answer_2":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.answer_2 }}","answer_3":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.answer_3 }}","is_correct_1":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.is_correct_1 }}","is_correct_2":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.is_correct_2 }}","is_correct_3":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.is_correct_3 }}","submitted_at":"={{ $('Calculate Score').item.json.submitted_at }}"}},"options":{}},"id":"46817a26-1764-4586-a510-9901a63ff687","name":"Insert into Data Table","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","typeVersion":1,"position":[608,672]},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"const calc = $('Calculate Score').first().json;\\n\\nconst isPass = calc.pass_status === 'ผ่าน';\\nconst themeColor = isPass ? '#10b981' : '#ef4444';\\nconst themeBg = isPass ? '#ecfdf5' : '#fef2f2';\\nconst themeBorder = isPass ? '#a7f3d0' : '#fecaca';\\n\\n// ตารางสรุปคำตอบรายข้อ (ถูก/ผิด) ให้นักเรียนเห็นว่าตอบข้อไหนพลาดบ้าง\\nconst perQuestion = [1, 2, 3].map((n) => {\\n  const correct = calc[`is_correct_${n}`];\\n  const answer = calc[`answer_${n}`] || '(ไม่ได้ตอบ)';\\n  const badgeColor = correct ? '#10b981' : '#ef4444';\\n  const badgeBg = correct ? '#ecfdf5' : '#fef2f2';\\n  const badgeText = correct ? 'ถูกต้อง' : 'ไม่ถูกต้อง';\\n  return `\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:13px;\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\"color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\\">ข้อ ${n}</div>\\n        <div style=\\"color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;\\">${answer}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span style=\\"flex-shrink:0;margin-left:12px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:${badgeBg};color:${badgeColor};font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\">${badgeText}</span>\\n    </div>`;\\n}).join('');\\n\\nconst html = `\\n<div style=\\"max-width:540px;margin:20px auto;padding:28px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid ${themeBorder};box-shadow:0 15px 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;\\">\\n  \\n  <div style=\\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\\">\\n    <div style=\\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 16px;background:${themeColor};color:#ffffff;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:12px;\\">\\n      ผลการประเมิน: ${calc.pass_status}\\n    </div>\\n    <h2 style=\\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:22px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700;\\">${calc.test_name}</h2>\\n    <p style=\\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#64748b;\\">วิชา ${calc.subject}</p>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"width:140px;height:140px;margin:24px auto;border-radius:50%;background:${themeBg};border:4px solid ${themeColor};display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\\">\\n    <div style=\\"font-size:42px;font-weight:800;color:${themeColor};line-height:1;\\">${calc.score}</div>\\n    <div style=\\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px;\\">/ ${calc.total_score} คะแนน</div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin:24px 0;\\">\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">ชื่อ-นามสกุล:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.student_name}</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">ระดับชั้น:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.grade_level}</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">ตอบถูกต้อง:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:${themeColor};\\">${calc.correct_count} / ${calc.total_questions} ข้อ (${calc.percentage}%)</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;\\">\\n      <span style=\\"color:#64748b;\\">เวลาที่ส่ง:</span>\\n      <span style=\\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\\">${calc.submitted_at}</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"margin:24px 0;\\">\\n    <div style=\\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:6px;\\">รายละเอียดคำตอบรายข้อ</div>\\n    <div style=\\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;padding:4px 20px;\\">${perQuestion}</div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"text-align:center;padding:12px;background:${themeBg};border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:${themeColor};margin-bottom:16px;\\">\\n    ${isPass ? '🎉 ยินดีด้วย! คุณผ่านเกณฑ์การประเมินเรียบร้อยแล้ว' : '📖 พยายามอีกนิดนะ! ทบทวนเนื้อหาบทเรียนเพิ่มเติม'}\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;\\">\\n    ✅ บันทึกผลคะแนนและคำตอบรายข้อลง n8n Data Table เรียบร้อยแล้ว\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n`;\\n\\nreturn [{ json: { html } }];","notice":""},"id":"50e7677a-aacb-4ea3-bec0-58f5eb99c087","name":"Format Success HTML","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[832,672]},{"parameters":{"triggerNotice":"","operation":"completion","respondWith":"showText","responseText":"={{ $json.html }}","limitWaitTime":false},"id":"e269f845-2ae9-4e31-9c9a-5ee2b22990a9","name":"Form: แสดงผลคะแนนสอบ","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","typeVersion":1,"position":[1040,672],"webhookId":"science-exam-success-result"}],"connections":{"n8n Form Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Calculate Score","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Calculate Score":{"main":[[{"node":"Check Existing in Data Table","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check Existing in Data Table":{"main":[[{"node":"Student Already Exists?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Student Already Exists?":{"main":[[{"node":"Format Warning HTML","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Insert into Data Table","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Format Warning HTML":{"main":[[{"node":"Form: แจ้งเตือนการส่งซ้ำ","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Insert into Data Table":{"main":[[{"node":"Format Success HTML","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Format Success HTML":{"main":[[{"node":"Form: แสดงผลคะแนนสอบ","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1","binaryMode":"separate","availableInMCP":false},"nodeGroups":[]}	[{"version":1,"startData":"1","resultData":"2","executionData":"3","resumeToken":"4","manualData":"5"},{"destinationNode":"6"},{"error":"7","runData":"8","pinData":"9","lastNodeExecuted":"10"},{"contextData":"11","nodeExecutionStack":"12","metadata":"13","waitingExecution":"14","waitingExecutionSource":"15","runtimeData":"16"},"30ecec1f02525ae604b9ce3dde21666032f6b1a1f6f4e13a3719453ceb09ad7b",{"us