EXM03 - n8n + Google drive + Google sheet	f	[{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","typeVersion":1,"position":[208,768],"id":"39084883-7f69-465e-9966-1c308283b102","name":"When clicking ‘Execute workflow’"},{"parameters":{"fieldToSplitOut":"results","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitOut","typeVersion":1,"position":[656,560],"id":"2f791b4c-2dc0-40ab-85a9-2d9c0849f45a","name":"Split Out"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"579743c7-1442-4596-bcaf-dd6a925a3728","name":"firstName","value":"={{ $json.name.first }}","type":"string"},{"id":"3eda7368-23a5-451d-825a-a754c9218783","name":"lastName","value":"={{ $json.name.last }}","type":"string"},{"id":"4e01f99b-3bea-4313-afd2-435afeef9081","name":"email","value":"={{ $json.email }}","type":"string"},{"id":"ae8bd0d9-d488-4271-aca4-14b314b59956","name":"phone","value":"={{ $json.phone }}","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[880,560],"id":"4c0db7d6-c41d-4838-8ee5-fac46488ffbf","name":"Edit Fields"},{"parameters":{"url":"https://randomuser.me/api/?results=5","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.3,"position":[432,560],"id":"dae95abe-7911-4842-9bf6-c4a9442cbba7","name":"Get 5 Random Users"},{"parameters":{"content":"### 🏗️ Workflow: Smart Random User Sync (Google Sheets)\\nThis workflow fetches random user data and intelligently syncs it to a Google Sheet, creating the file automatically if it doesn't already exist.\\n\\n---\\n#### 1. File Check & Initialization\\n* **Search files and folders:** Checks Google Drive for an existing spreadsheet named `users-contact`.\\n* **If (Logic):** * **TRUE:** If the file exists, it extracts the `Spread Sheet ID`.\\n    * **FALSE:** If the file is not found, it triggers the **Create spreadsheet** node to generate a new one.\\n\\n#### 2. Data Acquisition & Cleaning\\n* **Get 5 Random Users:** Pulls 5 new profiles from the `randomuser.me` API.\\n* **Split Out:** Flattens the API results into individual user items.\\n* **Edit Fields:** Maps raw JSON data into clean columns: `firstName`, `lastName`, `email`, and `phone`.\\n\\n#### 3. Data Integration\\n* **Merge:** Synchronizes the data stream from the \\"Edit Fields\\" node with the \\"Spread Sheet ID\\" identified in Step 1.\\n* **Append row in sheet:** Inserts the 5 new user records into the correct Google Sheet dynamically.\\n\\n---\\n**Key Feature:** Prevents errors by ensuring a destination file exists before attempting to write data.","height":480,"width":960,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,0],"typeVersion":1,"id":"30794e9b-860a-4798-bed0-6bab44638912","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"resource":"spreadsheet","title":"users-contact","sheetsUi":{"sheetValues":[{"title":"users"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","typeVersion":4.7,"position":[880,960],"id":"605abd95-7e9d-4046-a796-c69b72eaf93c","name":"Create spreadsheet"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":3},"conditions":[{"id":"f054f209-3d36-4acc-9f1e-fe81d5840c6e","leftValue":"={{ $json.id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty","singleValue":true}}],"combinator":"and"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2.3,"position":[656,800],"id":"9ae8be79-c8f7-4873-b09d-cbf8638b6a9c","name":"If"},{"parameters":{"mode":"chooseBranch"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","typeVersion":3.2,"position":[1104,656],"id":"8125b0fa-1e92-4fe3-91c5-22dde55bff5f","name":"Merge"},{"parameters":{"operation":"append","documentId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $node['Spread Sheet ID'].json.id }}","mode":"id"},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"value":"users","mode":"name"},"columns":{"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","value":{},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[{"id":"firstName","displayName":"firstName","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true,"remo