ls 5 new profiles from the `randomuser.me` API.\\n* **Split Out:** Flattens the API results into individual user items.\\n* **Edit Fields:** Maps raw JSON data into clean columns: `firstName`, `lastName`, `email`, and `phone`.\\n\\n#### 3. Data Integration\\n* **Merge:** Synchronizes the data stream from the \\"Edit Fields\\" node with the \\"Spread Sheet ID\\" identified in Step 1.\\n* **Append row in sheet:** Inserts the 5 new user records into the correct Google Sheet dynamically.\\n\\n---\\n**Key Feature:** Prevents errors by ensuring a destination file exists before attempting to write data.","height":480,"width":960,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,0],"typeVersion":1,"id":"30794e9b-860a-4798-bed0-6bab44638912","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"resource":"spreadsheet","title":"users-contact","sheetsUi":{"sheetValues":[{"title":"users"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","typeVersion":4.7,"position":[880,960],"id":"605abd95-7e9d-4046-a796-c69b72eaf93c","name":"Create spreadsheet"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":3},"conditions":[{"id":"f054f209-3d36-4acc-9f1e-fe81d5840c6e","leftValue":"={{ $json.id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty","singleValue":true}}],"combinator":"and"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2.3,"position":[656,800],"id":"9ae8be79-c8f7-4873-b09d-cbf8638b6a9c","name":"If"},{"parameters":{"mode":"chooseBranch"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","typeVersion":3.2,"position":[1104,656],"id":"8125b0fa-1e92-4fe3-91c5-22dde55bff5f","name":"Merge"},{"parameters":{"operation":"append","documentId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $node['Spread Sheet ID'].json.id }}","mode":"id"},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"value":"users","mode":"name"},"columns":{"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","value":{},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[{"id":"firstName","displayName":"firstName","required":false,"defa